{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"c95677ce2b0dc41257abccef24fe62f02ce6585e17e1dce250fa7bd081353baa","digest":{"component_or_area":"review-bot ASGI lifespan test harness","key_entities":["SHUTDOWN_DRAIN_SECONDS","DEFAULT_SHUTDOWN_DRAIN_SECONDS","tests/conftest.py","_bound_review_bot_shutdown_drain","tests/unit/test_review_bot.py","_safe_review_bot_lifespan_defaults","reconcile.reconcile_loop","rebar._snapshot.start_background_janitor","src/rebar/review_bot/config.py","shutdown_drain_seconds()"],"problem_keywords":["test lifespan","shutdown drain timeout","review-bot ASGI","reconciler background task","test fixture isolation","production default leakage"],"propositions":["Test suite inherits the production 1200-second shutdown drain default when entering the review-bot ASGI lifespan, causing unit tests to hang or run long background reconciliation and snapshot janitor tasks.","The production shutdown drain must remain exactly 1200 seconds in DEFAULT_SHUTDOWN_DRAIN_SECONDS, while all pytest tests must receive a bounded 1.0-second baseline via an autouse fixture.","TestClient entering the real application lifespan requires default stubs for reconcile_loop and snapshot janitor background tasks to prevent long-running side effects in ordinary tests.","Test-local SHUTDOWN_DRAIN_SECONDS overrides must take precedence over the suite baseline, and marked tests must be able to opt into the real production reconcile_loop with deterministic observability."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b2b5c498-2f67-4ae3-bafc-eca40294bec2","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787396224079558570,"uuid":"4bd838a2-56b6-4f3b-91ac-cf6b5c60d95f"}